    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2142$85 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 27 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'09'27No. 2142/85 - FRIDAY SEPTEMBER 27, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE PANADURA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Panadura Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to which PethahandiNevil Chandrasoma the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, todecide upon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a periodof thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Kumara Unnehelage Pradeep Nishshanka Dayas to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Wannakuwatta Waduge Kalindra Jayaweera Fernando, Returning Officer of the PanaduraPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Kumara Unnehelage Pradeep Nishshanka Dayas was selected as the member of the Panadura PradeshiyaSabha.\n\nKALINDRA JAYAWEERA FERNANDO,Returning Officer,Panadura Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kalutara,26th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 419\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
