    "chunk_text": "wxl 2143$26 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 02 jeks n\u00de\u00de - 2019'10'02\n\nNo. 2143/26 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 02, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nG 31156 - 47 (2019/10) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference No.: NCP/TK/9/11/LC/08-04. Land Ministry's Ref. No. : NCP/TK/9/SO/2019/343,354.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nLot Nos. 2553-2556 (04 Lots ) allotments in total extent ofabout 0.0055 Hectare,of land in Final Settled Town Plan No.3950, Supplement No.229, Sheet No.234 and dated 02.07.2019prepared by the Senior - Superintendent of Surveyor ofPolonnaruwa District on behalf of the Surveyor General,situated in the village of Polonnaruwa (Division No. 04),Galthabarawa (Municipal Council Area in Polonnaruwa), inthe Grama Niladhari Division of 172, Polonnaruwa Town, inthe Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thamankaduwa inPolonnaruwa District in the North Central Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 2553Name of land: Walawwewatta, Assmt. No. Cannot be found,Batticaloa Road - North; Description: Garden; Claimant: State;\n\nOriginal Claimant: \u2013 (Possess by Gonaduwage Premawathi,Batticaloa Road, Polonnaruwa); Extent: 0.0004 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2554Name of land: Walawwewatta, Assmt. No. Cannot be found,Batticaloa Road - North; Description: Garden, Contain a partof Permanent Building; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: \u2013(Possess by Wijenayaka Arachchi Patabadige Udaya NilminiWijenayaka, No. 132, Sahashra Multi Shop, Batticaloa Road,Polonnaruwa); Extent: 0.0008 Hectare."
