    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 1Assesment No. (Part of) 17, 175/1 and 17 8/1, JanadhipathiMawatha; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Standard Charted\n\nG 31173 - 47 (2019/10)\n\nBank at No. 37, York Street, Colombo 01; Present land useand description: A Permanent six storied building; Extent:0.2054 Hectare.\n\nD. P. WICKRAMASINGHE, Divisional Secretary, Colombo 12.\n\nDivisional Secretariat,Colombo,05th September 2019.\n\n10-625\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'03PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.20192A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS\n\nAMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISTION\n\n(AMENDMENT) ACT NO. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nRef. No. : CHI/LND.1/AC/4/14\n\nL/03J/95/PC/231.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theland Acqusition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following land which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired:\n\nSituated at Colombo Road (Within the Urban Council Limitsof Chilaw) in ward No. 08 and the Grama Niladhari Division of578 B Pitipana North, within the Divisional Secretary's Divisionof Chilaw in Anaivilundan Pattu Minor Division, PuttalamDistrict, North Western Province and depicted in plan No.P.P.Pu. 4849 dated 30.09.2011 and prepared by theSuperintentdent of Srveyor of Puttalam.\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of the land: Kaligala; Description: Road; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: Warnakulasuriya Mery MalaniFernando and Rejina Jasintha, Colombo Road, Chilaw; Extent:0.0132 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2Name of the land: Kaligala; Description: Road; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: Mihindukulasuriya Emmanuel NimalPerera, Colombo Road, Chilaw; Extent: 0.0090 Hectare.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n03. Lot No. 3Name of the land: Kaligala; Description: Road; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: Mihindukulasuriya Andrew JayanthaHilariyan Fernando, Colombo Road, Chilaw; Extent: 0.0090Hectare."
