    "chunk_text": "T. W. POSHITHA KAUMADI,Returning Officer,Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Matara,02nd October, 2019.\n\n10 - 635/1\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\n2AIV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.2019\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY THE OFFICE OF VICE CHAIRMAN OF THE KAMBURUPITIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66B(2) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BY LOCAL AUHORITIES ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 16 OF 2017\n\nWHEREAS the office of Vice Chairman in Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Appointmentas Chairman ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichWeerasinghe Kankanamge Ananda Weerasinghe the former Vice Chairman belonged, was required by me under Section66 B (2) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs tosuch party who shall be declared elected as Vice Chairman within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Lalith Alwis Samarasinghe to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Thananthiri Withanage Poshitha Kaumadi, Returning Officer of Kamburupitiya PradeshiyaSabha, acting in terms of Section 66B(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) as amended byLocal Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2017, do hereby declare Lalith Alwis Samarasinghe elected asVice Chairman of the Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nT. W. POSHITHA KAUMADI,Returning Officer,Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Matara,02nd October, 2019.\n\n10 - 635/2"
  },
