    "chunk_text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Thananthiri Withanage Poshitha Kaumadi, Returning Officer of Kamburupitiya PradeshiyaSabha, acting in terms of Section 66B(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) as amended byLocal Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2017, do hereby declare Lalith Alwis Samarasinghe elected asVice Chairman of the Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nT. W. POSHITHA KAUMADI,Returning Officer,Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Matara,02nd October, 2019.\n\n10 - 635/2\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichWeerasuriya Mudiyanselage Sanjeewa Priyanath the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1)(a) ofthe aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that 1 - Gathara of Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha who belongsto such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall bedeclared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Rejee Namel Wellappili to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Thananthiri Withanage Poshitha Kaumadi, Returning Officer of the KamburupitiyaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Rejee Namel Wellappili was elected as the member of the 1- Gathara Kamburupitiya PradeshiyaSabha.\n\nT. W. POSHITHA KAUMADI,Returning Officer,Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Matara,02nd October, 2019.\n\n10 - 635/3\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
