 Enactments of Ceylon (1956 RevisedEdition), as amended by Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial disputes - Special Provisions) Act,No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. K. M. Sarathchandra, No. 160, Mapalangedara, Diwulapitiya to be the arbitrator and refer theaforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration."
