    "chunk_text": "wxl 2144$2 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 07 jeks i\u00f7\u00de - 2019'10'07\n\nNo. 2144/2 \u2013 MONDAY, OCTOBER 07, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nG 31194 - 12 (2019/10)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: DIVBA/LND/ACQSTN/01/01/02.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, ofLand Acquisition Act No.28 of 1964 (Amended) that theGovernment intends to acquire the following lands which arerequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nFour allotment of land depicted in the Preliminary PlanNo. KU.2419 situated in the village called Hunukumbura inDewamadi Hathpaththuwe Walgampaththu Korale in theGrama Niladhari Division No. 1211 of Mirihampitiya in theDivisional Secretary's Division of Bamunakotuwa inKurunegala District of the North Western Province and morefully described as follows.\n\n01. Lot No. 01, P.P.KU. 2419Name of land: Udupitiya Kumbura; Claimant: K.V. Piyadasa;Extent: 0.0136 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02, P.P.KU. 2419Name of land: Udupitiya Kumbura; Claimant: K.V. PemaJayawardhana; Extent: 0.0186 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 03, P.P.KU. 2419Name of land: Udupitiya Kumbura; Claimant: K.V.Jayathunga; Extent: 0.0056 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 04, P.P.KU. 2419Name of land: Udupitiya Kumbura; Claimant: W.H.SarathJayaweera; Extent: 0.0177 Hectare."
