    "chunk_text": "10. Lot No. 10Name of the Land: Dikyaya; Description of Land: Estate;Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Rangiri DambuluRajamaha Viharaya. Cultivated by Herath MudiyanselageDewetegedara Suraweera Herath, Resident in Kapuwatta,Dambulla; Extent: 0.0283 Hectare.\n\nGedara Anura Palitha Leemagahadeniya, Resident in Polgollawatta, Polgolla; Extent: 0.0016 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired by are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Dambulla Divisional Secretariat, on the day of the 27th dayof November 2019 at 10.00 a.m and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st dayof November 2019 the nature of their interests in theparticulars of their claims for computation for the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.\n\nH. P. P. A. HEWAPATHIRANA,\n\nDivisional Secretary,\n\nDambulla.\n\nAt the Divisional Secretariat,Dambulla,01st October, 2019.\n\n10 - 799\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nCORRIGENDA\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No. 5/3/4/1-1857.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms\n\nReference No.: 4-3/7/2017/HW/94.\n\nIT should be Corrected as Divisional Secretariat of Dambulla,that mentioned as Udulla by a printing mistake F.V.P. 424,Supplementary No. 07 and sheet No. 07 published in Part IIIof Sinhala medium Extraordinary Gazette No. 2139/15 of theDemocratie Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka on 02.09.2019.\n\nH. P. P. A. HEWAPATHIRANA,\n\nDivisional Secretary,\n\nDambulla.\n\nAt the Divisional Secretariat,Dambulla,01st October, 2019.\n\n10 - 800\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
