    "chunk_text": "wxl 2144$13 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 08 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'10'08\n\nNo. 2144/13 \u2013 TUESDAY, OCTOBER 08, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nPG 4675 - 62 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: 3/1/83/2016.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms\n\nReference No.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/307.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following Land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 0.1244Hectare, Lots 285 - 297 (8 lots) under mentioned land shownin the Surveyor General\u2019s Cadastral Map No. 420165 , BlockNo.01, Sheet No.05, dated 22.05.2019 situated in the villageof Gopallawa in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 552,Gopallawa, in Rideegama Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division inKurunegala District of North Western Province:\n\n1. Lot No. 285Name of the Land: Maweekotuwa, Ihalawela aliasElagawadalupotha, Ihalawewawela; Description of Land:Paddy-Field; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: WansaHindagala; Extent: 0.0107 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 287Name of the Land: -; Description of Land: Paddy-Field;Claimant: Government; Encroached by Wansa Hindagala.;Extent: 0.0063 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 288Name of the Land: -; Description of Land: Paddy-Field;Claimant: Government; Encroached by W. W. P. W. M. RChintha Gopallawa Dassanayake; Extent: 0.0025 Hectare.\n\n4. Lot No. 289Name of the Land: -; Description of Land: Paddy-Field;Claimant: Government; Encroached by W. W. P. W. M. RChintha Gopallawa Dassanayake; Extent: 0.0038 Hectare."
